// Fixed: Dual-sided 3D backface visibility (no mirrored front text).
// Creative Back Side: Backstage Access Credential, Pit Code & Gate Rules, Active Dynamic QR Scanner.
// Persistent 3D rotation (stays where dropped, single click snaps back to default). Zero UI clutter.
---

<section id="about" class="relative w-full py-16 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-16 bg-[#FAF7F9] dark:bg-void-black border-t border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.06] overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
  
